~ misbehavior_gonzalo_2
Dispatcher: Gonzalo, are you there.
Gonzalo: [wave]munch ... munch ... munch[/wave]
Dispatcher: Not again, [shake freq=20.0 amp=5.0]Gonzalo![/shake]
Gonzalo: [i]Cough! Cough![/i] Uh, hello.
Dispatcher: Don't tell me you stopped again for more food?
Gonzalo: Well, I was already stopped, and the place here had some really tasty looking ...
Dispatcher: Look, bring some granola bars with you, or an apple, or something you can eat while on assignment, okay?
Gonzalo: Okay. Sorry.
=> END

~ misbehavior_hanna
Dispatcher: Agent Hanna, did you get your assignment?
Hanna: [i]OMG! I'm in Sparta, and it's like the cutest town![/i]
Dispatcher: Hanna, who are you talking to.
Hanna: Oh ... right ... hi! I mean, this is Hanna.
Dispatcher: Are you posting videos on social media?
Hanna: Well, you see, I'm always looking for new content, and ...
Dispatcher: and you are revealing to the suspect you're trying to track down exactly where you are.
Hanna: Right. I understand. Sorry.
=> END

~ misbehavior_hanna_2
Dispatcher: Hanna, why are you still there?
Hanna: [i]Hey guys! You won't believe this, but I just saw the most adorable fox! I was like, so close ...[/i]
Dispatcher: Don't tell me you're posting stuff again?
Hanna: Oh, yeah, no, I was just ... talking ... to my mom. Yeah, my mom. You see ...
Dispatcher: Tell your [i]mom[/i] that you're working and that you'll talk to her later.
Hanna: Got it.
=> END
